  m_Name: Q17
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::InterviewQuestionData
  question: "URP kh\xE1c Built-in Render Pipeline nh\u01B0 th\u1EBF n\xE0o? \u01AFu
    \u0111i\u1EC3m c\u1EE7a URP?"
  choices:
  - text: "URP m\u1EDBi h\u01A1n v\xE0 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c Unity strongly recommend."
    score: 1
    feedbackHint: "Ch\u01B0a gi\u1EA3i th\xEDch \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c technical difference."
  - text: "URP l\xE0 Scriptable Render Pipeline - customizable, performant h\u01A1n
      tr\xEAn mobile/mid-range. \u01AFu \u0111i\u1EC3m: single-pass forward rendering,
      Render Feature \u0111\u1EC3 inject custom passes, Shader Graph, 2D renderer.
      Kh\xF4ng h\u1ED7 tr\u1EE3 m\u1ED9t s\u1ED1 shader c\u0169 (c\u1EA7n convert).
      HDRP cho high-end visual, URP cho balance."
    score: 3
    feedbackHint: "Hi\u1EC3u Render Feature, bi\u1EBFt khi n\xE0o d\xF9ng URP vs
      HDRP."
  - text: "URP nh\u1EB9 h\u01A1n, performance t\u1ED1t h\u01A1n tr\xEAn mobile. H\u1ED7
      tr\u1EE3 Shader Graph. C\u1EA7n convert material khi migrate t\u1EEB Built-in."
    score: 2
    feedbackHint: "Bi\u1EBFt \u0111i\u1EC3m ch\xEDnh nh\u01B0ng ch\u01B0a \u0111\u1EC1
      c\u1EADp Render Feature."
  category: URP
